    "name": "A Totally Legal Archaeology Adventure",
    "steam_appid": 3568150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone!<br>I'm Andreas, and I'm so happy to finally present my first ever released game.<br>This project has been really fun, and I look forward to any feedback I receive which I am commited to use to further improve the gameplay, and make it as enjoyable as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unearth History, build a Museum, uncover a Secret.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just been hired as the <strong>museum manager</strong> for a prestigious yet mysterious institution. Your job? <strong>Travel across remote islands</strong>, dig up <strong>ancient artifacts</strong>, and curate the most impressive museum the world has ever seen!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig &amp; Discover:</strong> Hunt for rare artifacts across a variety of islands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Museum Tycoon Lite:</strong> Place, display, and grow your museum for more visitors &amp; income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong> Better tools and abilities gives higher efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Activities:</strong> Each new island presents a new activity, such as fishing and mining.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wealth accumulation:</strong> See how big you can make the pile of money in the basement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mystery to Unravel:</strong> The more you dig, the <strong>darker the truth becomes\u2026</strong> </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone!<br>I'm Andreas, and I'm so happy to finally present my first ever released game.<br>This project has been really fun, and I look forward to any feedback I receive which I am commited to use to further improve the gameplay, and make it as enjoyable as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unearth History, build a Museum, uncover a Secret.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just been hired as the <strong>museum manager</strong> for a prestigious yet mysterious institution. Your job? <strong>Travel across remote islands</strong>, dig up <strong>ancient artifacts</strong>, and curate the most impressive museum the world has ever seen!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig &amp; Discover:</strong> Hunt for rare artifacts across a variety of islands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Museum Tycoon Lite:</strong> Place, display, and grow your museum for more visitors &amp; income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong> Better tools and abilities gives higher efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Activities:</strong> Each new island presents a new activity, such as fishing and mining.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wealth accumulation:</strong> See how big you can make the pile of money in the basement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mystery to Unravel:</strong> The more you dig, the <strong>darker the truth becomes\u2026</strong> </p></li></ul>",
